# Raw provider responses, re-fetchable and large (~700 MB): 41 Overpass tiles,
# ~800 Copernicus DEM windows, 400 JRC GSW windows, the ASF HAND samples.
# Deleting this directory costs a ~2 h rebuild and nothing else.
cache/
*.log

# The monthly tower-month panel (~35,000 rows). Built by
# prepare_maintenance_records.py, read by nothing: it backs a model variant that
# was measured and rejected — predicting need in a 6-month forward window scored
# PR-AUC ~0.06-0.07 against the served 36-month model's 0.29, purely from the
# rarer base rate. maintenance_need.py names it in a docstring to record that
# result, not to load it. Regenerate if you want to re-run that comparison.
maintenance_panel.csv
